Answers a question asked of you, given the question's id; the answer wakes the chat that asked. Answer each question in the run it wakes you for, even if all you can say yet is that you don't know, or when you will: the asker may be waiting on it. Once you know more, answer the same question again, and that answer reaches it too. Answer from what is stored and what you have done, and say plainly what you are unsure of.
